  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Yan Tribe elders name her when they ask Ge tribe for help: Hao Ji Liu has kidnapped Yan tribe’s big missy Yan Cui Er, hides in crescent lake, and extorts the tribe after their rescue attempts fail. The same visit states she is engaged to Liu Wen Wu and that her status is Liu Wen Wu’s fiancée, which the elders use to pressure Ge Guang. At the lake edge Hao Ji Liu opens a giant fanshell and shows her gagged and tied inside so Yan Tian Ji can see her before the Gu handover.",
      "chapters": [
        470
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_yan_tribe",
        "fac_ge_tribe",
        "char_hao_ji_liu",
        "loc_crescent_lake",
        "char_liu_wen_wu",
        "char_ge_guang",
        "char_yan_tian_ji"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is a young girl.",
      "chapters": [
        470
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She is beautiful like a flower and has thick brows.",
      "chapters": [
        473
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At the heroes assembly she is a beautiful young girl in gorgeous attire.",
      "chapters": [
        497
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the battle on the shore intensifies, she remains on the lake as a hostage and watches with a dumbfounded look as the fight develops away from the ransom she had been the reason for.",
      "chapters": [
        472
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hostage-at-the-lakeside-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan’s past-life memory already places the later path: after capturing her and extorting Yan tribe, Hao Ji Liu offers her to Hei Lou Lan at the heroes assembly.",
      "chapters": [
        472
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "after-yan-tribes-higher-ups-fall",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_hei_lou_lan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the present, Hao Ji Liu escapes the wolf fight with her in a clam Gu and lands on a floating island on crescent lake. He tells her Chang Shan Yin killed her father and the elders, and that the wolf group will take Yan tribe camp next. She kneels and begs him to send a letter, claims that with her father dead she is Yan tribe’s next leader, and offers to make him an external elder if the tribe survives; he slaps her, refuses, and tosses her back into the clam Gu to escort her to young master Hei Lou Lan as a meeting gift meant to strike at rival Liu Wen Wu.",
      "chapters": [
        473
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "after-yan-tribes-higher-ups-fall",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chang_shan_yin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the assembly Hei Lou Lan orders her to bring a new cup and pour wine; she walks forward in gorgeous attire and serves him. The same stretch restates that she is Yan tribe’s eldest daughter and Liu Wen Wu’s fiancée, that Hao Ji Liu offered her to Hei Lou Lan as a meeting gift, and that Hei Lou Lan brought her to attack Liu Wen Wu. When Hei Lou Lan offers to return her if Liu Wen Wu admits defeat, Liu Wen Wu laughs her off and tells Hei Lou Lan to keep her.",
      "chapters": [
        497
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "bargaining-chip-between-rivals",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Later, when Fang Yuan as Chang Shan Yin sides with Hei Lou Lan, Liu Wen Wu’s private thought again treats Yan Cui Er as a wife-to-be he can discard, both from northern plains patriarchal custom and because Yan tribe has already been exterminated.",
      "chapters": [
        499
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "bargaining-chip-between-rivals",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The fan translation body text writes Yan Cui Er and Yan tribe’s big missy Yan Cui Er.",
      "chapters": [
        470
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "translation-notes",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The fan translation does not print Chinese characters for the personal name.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
